      "value": "<p>You can cause a corpse to explode like a literal bomb.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Death sphere (Corpse Bomb), Destruction sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may use a destructive blast to activate your Corpse Bomb talent instead of a ghost strike. Affected targets are allowed a Reflex save for half damage.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/death#toc87\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
